      "connectsTo": "https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/609327",
      "details": "<p>Although evidently reused and damaged and therefore not found in situ, the honorific inscription published in Akinci \u00d6zt\u00fcrk 2015 was found at modern Akkent. It specifically mentions for the first time a temple (the cult of Zeus Tros(s)ou is attested on other inscriptions from this geographical area) and lists individuals bearing the ethnic \"Atyochoreites\".</p>",
